WEBVTT

00:01:36.470 --> 00:01:38.090
You certainly deserve

00:01:38.090 --> 00:01:41.090
your reputation as one of
Athena's most powerful Saints,

00:01:41.090 --> 00:01:43.750
a Gold Saint.

00:01:47.290 --> 00:01:52.920
But how do you plan to keep me here,
under these circumstances?

00:01:52.920 --> 00:01:56.310
And you know, my underlings have already left

00:01:56.310 --> 00:01:58.930
and will soon destroy the village.

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:02.420
Fool.

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.560
Your subordinates are the ones
who will be destroyed.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.020
What?

00:02:09.020 --> 00:02:13.920
Don't think that there is but
one source of Demon Roses.

00:02:18.290 --> 00:02:21.630
So that's the village Sir Minos described.

00:02:21.630 --> 00:02:25.160
The Sanctuary is right before us.

00:02:25.720 --> 00:02:29.160
We'll follow his orders and turn
the village into a sea of blood!

00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:30.320
Yeah!

00:02:31.760 --> 00:02:34.680
We'll avenge our colleagues
who were struck down

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:36.090
by Albafica!

00:02:38.760 --> 00:02:39.930
I smell roses...

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:58.740
Th-This...

00:02:58.740 --> 00:03:01.110
<i>Bloody Rose...</i>

00:03:03.190 --> 00:03:05.820
A white rose that flies toward the enemy,

00:03:06.810 --> 00:03:09.840
ultimately piercing straight through to the heart.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:13.920
When the white rose's petals turn completely red,

00:03:13.920 --> 00:03:16.560
your troops will die!

00:03:17.990 --> 00:03:20.420
<i>The horrifying, demon rose...</i>

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:24.680
<i>Nay, the Pisces Gold Saint.</i>

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:29.250
<i>Albafica.</i>

00:03:30.930 --> 00:03:37.320
Well, it looks as if my underlings'
Cosmo has disappeared.

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:46.200
Your subordinates have been killed.
Why do you laugh?

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.950
Sorry.

00:03:48.950 --> 00:03:51.790
You're really something, Gold Saint.

00:03:53.670 --> 00:03:55.750
You're worthy of my destroying you!

00:04:12.430 --> 00:04:15.200
So this is the fog of blood that killed Niobe.

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:19.280
This makes it interesting.

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:22.380
Now what?

00:04:22.380 --> 00:04:28.200
Run me through first, or should I break you first?

00:04:28.980 --> 00:04:30.700
I thought I told you...

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:36.430
You can break my arms, my legs, my face...

00:04:36.430 --> 00:04:39.090
But I will not let you through!

00:04:40.780 --> 00:04:42.670
You said it!

00:04:54.530 --> 00:04:58.020
<i>Crimson Thorn!</i>

00:05:17.040 --> 00:05:24.210
Honestly, I didn't expect a pretty boy
like you to be so tough.

00:05:27.480 --> 00:05:30.260
But you're not strong enough.

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:33.570
Not to resist being controlled,

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:38.440
to show your own power, to destroy others!

00:05:40.210 --> 00:05:41.860
Bastard...

00:06:02.600 --> 00:06:03.800
Flower petals...

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:14.010
You were quite an enjoyable puppet.

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:16.240
Albafica.

00:06:19.980 --> 00:06:24.280
Father, I feel that something
may have happened to Sir Albafica.

00:06:24.980 --> 00:06:27.450
Don't worry, Agasha.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:31.490
He's a powerful Gold Saint.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:40.330
So this is the village he was trying to protect.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:44.460
I see. What a nice, quiet village.

00:06:44.980 --> 00:06:46.340
But...

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:52.800
I'll destroy it for you.

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:02.730
No.

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:03.940
Let's go, Agasha!

00:07:08.310 --> 00:07:09.400
Father?

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.750
Father!

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:16.610
Be strong.

00:07:16.610 --> 00:07:22.190
D-Don't worry about me...
Go to the Sanctuary...

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:27.130
If you go to the Sanctuary, you can get help.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.380
But...

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:30.760
Live.

00:07:32.120 --> 00:07:34.680
Go quickly...

00:07:42.810 --> 00:07:45.260
<i>This isn't happening.</i>

00:07:50.570 --> 00:07:53.280
<i>Sir Albafica was supposed to protect us.</i>

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:55.300
<i>He promised.</i>

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.030
<i>I know...</i>

00:07:57.500 --> 00:07:59.740
<i>I know he'll come.</i>

00:08:00.510 --> 00:08:02.000
<i>I'm certain!</i>

00:08:09.050 --> 00:08:10.920
Oh, no.

00:08:11.440 --> 00:08:13.410
All the flower petals will fall off

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:15.300
before I can bring these to the Pope.

00:08:18.960 --> 00:08:19.810
Huh?

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:25.520
Thank you so much.

00:08:27.250 --> 00:08:28.920
Don't come near me.

00:08:37.800 --> 00:08:42.080
I just wanted to thank him.
That was so mean of him.

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:44.120
Well, don't say that.

00:08:44.120 --> 00:08:47.460
He has his reasons for avoiding people.

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:54.050
He believes his very body will hurt others.

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:55.230
Why?

00:08:55.970 --> 00:08:59.130
Because he has trained for
so many years to resist poison,

00:08:59.130 --> 00:09:01.710
his blood has apparently turned toxic.

00:09:01.710 --> 00:09:05.160
He's afraid of endangering others
with his own blood,

00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:07.690
so he keeps himself away from people.

00:09:07.690 --> 00:09:09.290
Oh, I see.

00:09:09.920 --> 00:09:11.480
<i>So at that time...</i>

00:09:11.480 --> 00:09:14.190
<i>I thought I understood.</i>

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:23.110
Father, I will return the cape I was loaned
to the Sanctuary.

00:09:23.110 --> 00:09:25.640
You probably won't be able
to hand it to him directly.

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:26.460
That's okay.

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:28.740
That he's a strong man...

00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:30.710
And that he's a kind man.

00:09:31.240 --> 00:09:33.620
I want to tell people.

00:09:33.620 --> 00:09:37.400
Out of respect, out of gratitude. If only I could...

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:42.340
<i>Like on that rainy day,</i>

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:44.030
<i>he kept...</i>

00:09:46.110 --> 00:09:48.310
<i>fighting on his own.</i>

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:56.570
Well, I seem to be coming across
a lot of roses today.

00:09:59.170 --> 00:10:02.830
That rose... You are related
to the Pisces Saint, are you not?

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:07.330
Then I'll get rid of you, just as I got rid of him.

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:13.340
You're the man who fought Sir Albafica?

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:19.520
Yes. I thought Gold Saints were
supposed to be powerful.

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:22.720
But I had a good time.

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:26.650
You didn't defeat Sir Albafica.

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:28.350
What?

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:34.080
I said, Athena's Saints will
never lose to the Specters.

00:10:34.080 --> 00:10:35.110
Fool!

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:40.860
Is that so? I see.

00:10:40.860 --> 00:10:44.490
But I'm in a hurry, so I'll be going ahead.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:46.330
I haven't time for small talk...

00:10:47.310 --> 00:10:49.440
with one so powerless.

00:10:58.570 --> 00:11:00.050
<i>Gold Cloth?</i>

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.800
I'll take care of this place!

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:06.930
Hurry! Run!

00:11:08.060 --> 00:11:11.440
<i>It wasn't Sir Albafica.</i>

00:11:13.070 --> 00:11:19.190
So even Aries Shion makes an appearance.
Is this revenge for the Pisces Saint?

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:23.320
It means a Specter strong
enough to defeat the

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:26.450
Pisces Gold Saint has attacked Rodorio Village.

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:30.100
I, first of the twelve houses of the zodiac,

00:11:30.100 --> 00:11:33.270
should be first to attack.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:34.710
Moreover...

00:11:36.020 --> 00:11:38.960
I really don't like you, personally!

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:43.710
This truly is a demonstration
of failing to learn a lesson.

00:11:43.710 --> 00:11:47.220
I'm sorry to say, but just like Albafica,

00:11:49.030 --> 00:11:51.670
I'll have you exit quickly.

00:11:51.670 --> 00:11:52.730
What?

00:11:54.220 --> 00:11:55.610
<i>The arm's moving on its own.</i>

00:11:56.180 --> 00:11:58.480
I can't be bothered to mess around.

00:11:58.890 --> 00:12:01.360
I'll just break your neck and finish you off.

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.290
It's over!

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:18.920
What?

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:22.920
Black roses?

00:12:23.350 --> 00:12:24.680
No way!

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.750
I'm sorry,

00:12:46.750 --> 00:12:48.320
Shion.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:53.290
For causing you trouble.

00:12:56.290 --> 00:13:00.040
I can still fight.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:04.550
<i>Impossible. I broke every bone in his body.</i>

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:07.390
I also have a favor to ask.

00:13:08.190 --> 00:13:12.310
Keep everyone except the enemy away from me.

00:13:17.400 --> 00:13:20.350
<i>What makes you push yourself so...</i>

00:13:21.240 --> 00:13:23.530
<i>Pisces Albafica?</i>

00:13:25.810 --> 00:13:28.630
I'm surprised you're still alive.

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:32.910
If you had just died,
you could have faded away beautifully.

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:37.220
It will be the same,
no matter how many times we do this.

00:13:37.750 --> 00:13:41.950
The weak will yield and be defeated.

00:13:41.950 --> 00:13:45.860
But I can't bear to see someone
as beautiful as you get covered

00:13:45.860 --> 00:13:47.180
in more blood and mud.

00:13:48.240 --> 00:13:50.430
I'll turn a blind eye.

00:13:52.430 --> 00:13:55.060
Up till now, Minos...

00:13:55.630 --> 00:14:00.010
Up till now, I've been alienated by my
own blood, and I've avoided people.

00:14:00.010 --> 00:14:04.590
I believe I would have lived thus,
no matter how I looked.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:13.730
The word "beautiful" always hurts my pride,
as did you just now.

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:17.460
What gives you the right?

00:14:18.030 --> 00:14:19.580
I have yet to reveal

00:14:19.580 --> 00:14:22.840
the full potential of my strength.

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:27.340
Of my Cosmo and my life!

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:30.840
Then I'll have you show me

00:14:31.220 --> 00:14:33.990
just how powerful you are!

00:14:35.970 --> 00:14:39.420
<i>Crimson Thorn!</i>

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:42.930
Fool!

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:45.360
The Crimson Thorn doesn't work on me!

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:47.610
<i>No...</i>

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:51.940
<i>The Crimson Thorn is achieved
by using your own toxic blood</i>

00:14:51.940 --> 00:14:54.240
<i>and turning it from the form
of a fog into that of a needle.</i>

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:57.580
<i>But this amount and strength is extraordinary.</i>

00:14:59.930 --> 00:15:03.480
<i>No! Does he plan to throw
all his blood at him? Albafica!</i>

00:15:05.870 --> 00:15:10.260
You talked big, but it looks
like you're almost done.

00:15:11.750 --> 00:15:14.600
Shall we finish this, already?

00:15:21.060 --> 00:15:23.280
Sir Albafica!

00:15:23.280 --> 00:15:27.630
It seems you're completely spent.

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:30.570
Are you my next opponent, Aries Saint?

00:15:31.110 --> 00:15:35.580
No, there is no need to fight
a man who's been defeated.

00:15:35.580 --> 00:15:36.850
What?

00:15:38.380 --> 00:15:40.750
You should look at your chest.

00:15:41.860 --> 00:15:43.250
Is this...

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:47.500
The Demon Rose he had in his mouth...

00:15:49.200 --> 00:15:50.380
When did he...

00:15:50.380 --> 00:15:55.710
No, Minos, that red rose is not a Demon Rose.

00:15:55.710 --> 00:15:58.740
It's the white rose that sucks a
person's blood and grows red...

00:15:58.740 --> 00:16:00.350
The Bloody Rose.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:02.640
No... A white rose?

00:16:02.640 --> 00:16:04.150
Yes.

00:16:04.150 --> 00:16:06.400
The white rose has sucked all of

00:16:06.810 --> 00:16:11.090
Albafica's own poisonous blood and turned red.

00:16:16.280 --> 00:16:21.290
His goal was never the Crimson Thorn.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:26.680
You failed to take Albafica's
strength seriously enough.

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:38.470
That I would lose my life to a drop
of poison from a single flower.

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:40.570
Impudent Albafica!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:46.980
You impudent Saints of Athena!

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:48.980
<i>No.</i>

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:53.490
I'll blow you and the whole village away!

00:16:53.490 --> 00:16:57.760
<i>Gigantic Feathers Flap!</i>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:07.000
<i>Break everything!</i>

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:08.790
<i>Everything!</i>

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:15.260
<i>Crystal Wall.</i>

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:18.610
This wall repels all attacks.

00:17:18.610 --> 00:17:21.220
Albafica risked his life to protect this village.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:24.230
You may not destroy it!

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:28.830
You...

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:38.960
Is it over?

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:42.580
Sir Albafica!

00:17:42.580 --> 00:17:44.700
Don't come near me!

00:17:45.680 --> 00:17:46.690
But...

00:17:56.090 --> 00:18:01.550
The rose petals Minos blew away
flew all the way over here.

00:18:02.360 --> 00:18:05.600
But they're missing their aroma.

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:10.980
I have always been with these poison roses.

00:18:11.910 --> 00:18:16.670
But now, this might be the first time...

00:18:21.300 --> 00:18:24.810
<i>I ever felt these flowers to be beautiful.</i>

00:18:43.090 --> 00:18:44.580
Sir Shion!

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:57.910
If the Holy War continues, will Saints keep dying?

00:18:57.910 --> 00:19:03.240
Will people like Sir Albafica fight and get hurt? I...

00:19:03.700 --> 00:19:08.350
I don't want to see the Saints hurt.

00:19:08.350 --> 00:19:11.500
I didn't want Sir Albafica to die!

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:19.010
We don't fight to die.

00:19:21.540 --> 00:19:25.400
The most important duty of my life...

00:19:25.400 --> 00:19:29.770
My life's purpose is to protect the
love and justice upon this Earth.

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:35.520
It is not to die. I fight to carry out my duty.

00:19:36.230 --> 00:19:40.660
Even if death or something else
awaits us on the other side...

00:19:42.410 --> 00:19:45.490
...we will continue to fight.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:48.560
Until the moment our lives are extinguished.

00:19:49.120 --> 00:19:53.000
<i>But at this rate,
the Pisces Saint's death will be for naught.</i>

00:19:53.440 --> 00:19:54.500
Who are you?

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:58.390
<i>This is the first time we have met.
My name is Atla.</i>

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:02.360
Teleportation?

00:20:07.350 --> 00:20:09.310
I come from Jamir.

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:12.600
Please take me quickly to the Pope.

00:20:12.600 --> 00:20:16.940
At this rate, the Sanctuary will fall!

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:25.810
It looks as if Minos has taken the life
of the Pisces Gold Saint, Albafica.

00:20:25.810 --> 00:20:30.830
But at the same time, the Cosmo of Minos
and his men has also disappeared.

00:20:36.700 --> 00:20:39.710
But I'm hesitant.

00:20:40.650 --> 00:20:44.820
It may give our Specters who have been

00:20:44.820 --> 00:20:48.660
freed of the shackles of life,
pain and suffering again.

00:20:52.480 --> 00:20:54.790
Reawaken now,

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:56.670
my Specters.

00:20:59.730 --> 00:21:02.070
From the tranquility of death...

00:21:02.490 --> 00:21:05.070
From eternal peace...

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:09.200
Return and fight again for me.

00:21:09.910 --> 00:21:13.660
As you wish, Lord Hades!

00:21:14.360 --> 00:21:17.920
We never could have defeated the Sanctuary.

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:19.920
Athena.

00:21:20.530 --> 00:21:22.130
Im-Impossible!

00:21:22.130 --> 00:21:23.960
Specters don't die?

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:24.800
No.

00:21:25.840 --> 00:21:26.800
Then...

00:21:27.410 --> 00:21:30.810
Then what did Albafica die for?

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:33.670
And not just Albafica!

00:21:33.670 --> 00:21:35.810
What about all our colleagues who have perished?

00:21:35.810 --> 00:21:38.010
Calm yourself, Shion.

00:21:38.010 --> 00:21:41.820
We are not just sitting idly by.

00:21:41.820 --> 00:21:46.050
Lady Athena already makes her move.

00:21:46.050 --> 00:21:49.430
She has cast a strong protective spell
over all of the Sanctuary,

00:21:49.430 --> 00:21:55.980
and she obstructs Hades's Cosmo,
as he reawakens the fallen Specters.

00:21:55.980 --> 00:22:01.110
But maintaining the protective spell
puts a very heavy strain on Lady Athena.

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:05.390
The only thing we can do is to defeat Hades

00:22:05.390 --> 00:22:08.270
and end the Holy War as soon as possible.

00:22:09.850 --> 00:22:11.230
No.

00:22:11.230 --> 00:22:15.060
I have an important message
regarding this from the Master.

00:22:16.110 --> 00:22:19.810
One more day...
Please hold out for one more day,

00:22:19.810 --> 00:22:23.320
and we will surely deliver,
to Lady Athena, good news...

00:22:26.350 --> 00:22:29.040
Along with the Pegasus Saint!

00:24:03.340 --> 00:24:06.060
Tenma, I want to see you.

00:24:06.610 --> 00:24:08.830
Let's change this world together.

00:24:09.590 --> 00:24:14.010
Let's bring tranquility and peace
to this world, the world of death.

00:24:15.100 --> 00:24:17.080
Paint the world black...

00:24:17.670 --> 00:24:21.480
I know that is happiness for me and for you.

00:24:22.640 --> 00:24:26.760
Next time on <i>Saint Seiya: The Lost Canvas –</i>

00:24:26.760 --> 00:24:28.010
<i>The Myth of Hades</i>...

00:24:28.440 --> 00:24:29.930
Golden Rain.
